d80c6ff9-f315-4adf-b251-71956b790d42	Initial Application Rejection	Update on your application for {{position_title}} at ContactPoint 360	<p>Dear {{candidate_name}},</p>\n<p>Thank you for your interest in the <strong>{{position_title}}</strong> position at ContactPoint 360. After careful review of your application, we have decided not to move forward with your candidacy at this time.</p>\n<p><strong>Reason for decision:</strong> {{reason}}</p>\n<p>We appreciate the time you took to apply and wish you the best in your career pursuits.</p>\n<p>Best regards,<br>Talent Acquisition Team<br>ContactPoint 360</p>	REJECTION_INITIAL	t	2026-04-20 23:18:26.832306+08	\N	\N	\N
1b2a18bf-63b5-44cf-960f-27bd16faf2fe	Post-Interview Rejection	Regarding your interview for {{position_title}}	<p>Dear {{candidate_name}},</p>\n<p>Thank you for taking the time to interview with us for the <strong>{{position_title}}</strong> role. We enjoyed learning more about your experience and qualifications.</p>\n<p>While we were impressed with your background, we have decided to move forward with other candidates whose profiles more closely align with our current organizational needs.</p>\n<p><strong>Update:</strong> {{reason}}</p>\n<p>We will keep your resume on file for future opportunities. Thank you again for your interest in ContactPoint 360.</p>\n<p>Best regards,<br>Hiring Committee<br>ContactPoint 360</p>	REJECTION_FINAL	t	2026-04-20 23:18:26.83867+08	\N	\N	\N
4fe44c8e-7007-46da-95b9-574d62cbb193	Account Welcome Email	Welcome to ContactPoint 360!	Hi {{full_name}},<br><br>Your account has been successfully created as a **{{role_label}}**. You can now log in to the portal using your email: **{{email}}**.<br><br>Please use the default password provided by your administrator for your first login.<br><br>Welcome aboard!<br><br>Best regards,<br>The CP360 Team	WELCOME_USER	t	2026-04-20 23:43:25.149508+08	\N	\N	\N
3628cbe4-0ef3-489a-ad0d-fda799634055	RCBC Template	CP360 | RCBC APPLICATION	<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"><style type="text/css" style="display:none;"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body dir="ltr">\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black;">\r\nHello Team,&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black;">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black;">\r\nPlease view the links below for RCBC&nbsp;Application. Make sure to fill out both&nbsp;forms.</div>\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black;">\r\nThe file attached is a guide on how to navigate the forms and minimize errors during the application process.</div>\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black;">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black;">\r\n<b>RCBC&nbsp;Application&nbsp;Form:</b></div>\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black;">\r\n<a href="https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftouch.rcbc.com%3A8085%2F%3F%2FMjAyMzAwMDAxNw%3D%3D%2FTE5K%2FU0FQMTg%3D%2FUEhQ%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7CWill.Badillo%40contactpoint360.com%7Cb2e83ec8a8134d63548408dea61f56a6%7C6fbab686c69b4a53a9c70d6b4ecd30ca%7C1%7C0%7C639130851140148961%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=C1OEKxjGSnXbrqZPueM1GZ3setFWMv54BcHOwCttm%2BY%3D&amp;reserved=0" originalsrc="https://touch.rcbc.com:8085/?/MjAyMzAwMDAxNw==/TE5K/U0FQMTg=/UEhQ/" id="OWA52b9e027-2206-13f7-8fc1-c99efd0b2e01" class="OWAAutoLink" title="Original URL: https://touch.rcbc.com:8085/?/MjAyMzAwMDAxNw==/TE5K/U0FQMTg=/UEhQ/. Click or tap if you trust this link." rel="noopener noreferrer" originalsrc="https://touch.rcbc.com:8085/?/MjAyMzAwMDAxNw==/TE5K/U0FQMTg=/UEhQ/" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="0" style="margin: 0px;">https://touch.rcbc.com:8085/?/MjAyMzAwMDAxNw==/TE5K/U0FQMTg=/UEhQ/</a></div>\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black;">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black;">\r\n**Reminders: Position - Employee to Middle Manager</div>\r\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px;