49897016-6aed-4bb0-aded-5d530ea5a5f6	PEME Tempkate	PEME	Hello Candidate,\r\n\r\nGood day!\r\n\r\nYou are scheduled to undergo your Pre-Employment Medical Examination (PEME) on {{schedule}}. This is the next step in your application process.\r\nPlease follow the steps below:\r\n\r\n1. Go to the Recruitment Hub first to get your PEME slip. (Note: The recruitment hub is open from 10 AM onwards)\r\n\r\n2. Proceed to Total Health Check Diagnostics Corporation, Skyrise 3, Jose Maria del Mar, IT Park, Cebu City, and complete all required medical procedures.\r\n\r\n3. After completing your PEME, return to the Recruitment Hub to submit your PEME slip.\r\n\r\nKindly note that this schedule has been specifically reserved for you. Completion of this requirement is mandatory to proceed with your application. You must complete your PEME and be declared fit to work before you can join the class.\r\n\r\nFailure to attend may affect your slot and may result in the examination cost being shouldered personally. If you have already completed your PEME, you may disregard this message.\r\n\r\nWe highly encourage you to complete this within the scheduled date.\r\n\r\nThank you. 	PEME	t	2026-05-11 21:12:33.058029+08	2026-05-13 23:53:11.669694+08	\N	\N
